"""Northern and eastern Europe: Denmark, Norway, Sweden, Finland, Iceland, Greenland, Sápmi, Estonia, Latvia, Lithuania,
Poland, Czechia, Slovakia, Hungary, Russia, Ukraine, Belarus and Moldova. The Kalmar Union and Denmark-Norway are at home
in Denmark, Sweden-Norway in Sweden, the Avars and Magyars in Hungary, Kyivan Rus' in Ukraine (ruled from Kyiv), the
Golden Horde in Russia (ruled from Sarai on the Volga), the Scythians on the Black Sea steppe in Ukraine."""
from _lib import L, P

